<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-21T13:59:58.737Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:59:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese coast guard and navy vessels are monitoring Philippine supply missions to a grounded ship at Ren'ai Jiao and also shadowing a U.S. warship near a disputed shoal, while the Philippines summoned China’s ambassador over threatening remarks. Vice Admiral Rommel Supangan took command of the Philippine Coast Guard and led a rescue of four people, including a child, on Hagonoy Island, Surigao del Sur. Taiwan’s coast guard and maritime forces repelled sixteen mainland Chinese ships near the Pratas Islands. The United States and the Philippines conducted their sixteenth bilateral maritime exercise in the West Philippine Sea. There were 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNdTQyY2ZrQm1kT0JUNy1VTFUxZVVuMHhqVEFFSkl0RDY3ZWpuQjQybnhNSE1UZTdtUXA0bTh2MU5KSlh0amZIaVFiMDhPVi1ZQV9nVG5DaHBVOE1jUS1OUnVzOEFwQUNnY3ljbnBqQkNGM242a21id1pBRk56UUhkeXRFMGZxQzFWYlZJaXE2ZXhoa0tHelh1V2loc19TS1psNjVzMFptQlNBdjJfU3REQzhOSEZUakdQN1NWTEtpcmh0Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPLWJEdzdFUFpXTndjZEYwSTF1RmZwSDh1dV9jd2dNY0xObzhkNHJuNE9xQ0Y0SXl1emxMYkw3TG44b25vbFo5YkhxY2tEVmhZdVpsY3RXMHliRG56NlNfWGwydHZWcTE2c29IWF8xaUw1WFpldmhRZjhWelRaZ081TTFNTWxOTWdPOWVNYXQ3ZjZ6eG9qd2NpOGZaQURpV1lUSmlMQ0VpZUJnME5MMkRuOWZSN3Y?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Straits Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1GUTVNLTVna2RkQ184a29MREJpYUgyTFA4eHYzd2xULUl5dTBzemc2QWJpY2lEZjU5UERKVmV6ZmctUWR2V2tBWFRqVGxmZGlzRUJYQTJQZGxzaVFNWnRmR1U0aUpyVXBERUplc3JGbWRPYThQZFZhZlg1Qk9EUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;China Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE5UX1N5T0U0WUpRRUExOEJ4aHI1R1R4dD